Authors@R: person("sunbjt", "sunbjt", email = "sunbjt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-utility sequential pattern mining for positive-utility single-item events,
    implemented in R and Rcpp. Supports minimum utility thresholds, Top-K mining,
    maximum pattern length, and deterministic result ordering.
